38:20.040 --> 38:25.140
But a civilization faces a critical existential danger called projection collapse.

38:25.140 --> 38:33.260
This happens when the civilization stops optimizing for actual reality and starts optimizing for heavily compressed proxies of reality.

38:33.760 --> 38:36.200
Let's define the terms the text uses here.

38:36.340 --> 38:39.900
