41:18.460 --> 41:24.280
but the metric cannot see the invisible dimensions of epistemic quality or mental health or objective truth.

41:24.460 --> 41:28.020
Because the algorithm doesn't care if you're angry or happy, just that you're clicking.

41:28.280 --> 41:30.640
Because those dimensions are invisible to the proxy,

41:30.640 --> 41:38.140
the optimization algorithm pulls the entire global information ecosystem off the reality manifold and into high-dimensional noise.

41:38.440 --> 41:42.920
The proxy manifold rotates entirely away from the reality manifold.

