44:14.780 --> 44:17.200
True intelligence is disciplined refusal.

44:17.920 --> 44:19.400
It is knowing what to ignore.

44:19.400 --> 44:22.340
That is exactly the dynamic, and it scales perfectly.

44:22.740 --> 44:30.340
A coherent human mind, a coherent artificial intelligence, and a coherent civilization all share that exact same discipline of refusal.

